    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/039d85a2-f0b7-434d-84d0-84805ba09b21.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "而对于未来ROE趋势的判断，此前我们框架中的一个简单传导链条是：狭义目标赤字 → 广义财政 → PPI → ROE。",
      "path": "assets/figure_005.png",
      "sha256": "397b34aadcbb45d807c1e55e03c76215020d238efe3a17a301dfdfd1ddcec4e5",
      "bytes": 239472,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 519,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/039d85a2-f0b7-434d-84d0-84805ba09b21.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/b4c69859-7dbb-4737-8262-f45389787d0f.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "23年底、24年初，市场逐步意识到目标赤字率可能比较低于预期，于是市场放弃了对24年广义财政的乐观预期，进而认为PPI和ROE很难全面回升，因此24年初市场的跌幅非常大。",
      "path": "assets/figure_006.png",
      "sha256": "448af9ffca6cbb6a983f7eaef7c25d9d8de1f25547c34d1789039e542fd5fde4",
      "bytes": 404218,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 552,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/b4c69859-7dbb-4737-8262-f45389787d0f.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/c89e691c-f7e8-43df-a2e3-b0910777b825.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "12月，在利率快速下行和保险公司有增量配置资金的预期推动下，红利类指数一度表现相对不错，但是开年也出现了较大幅度的下跌。",
      "path": "assets/figure_007.png",
      "sha256": "c5487697739ef710aae801706e5e4663d5f0a85e39e1b1905a93646af5b54e0d",
      "bytes": 248495,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 491,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/c89e691c-f7e8-43df-a2e3-b0910777b825.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/09c8d778-37fd-48f0-8fe0-42899c767eb0.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "",
      "path": "assets/figure_008.png",
      "sha256": "e30b0e9935853abdec08037e02ffe4608304d58cfa1bb832fa45e75e9d1f1dba",
      "bytes": 511120,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 640,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/09c8d778-37fd-48f0-8fe0-42899c767eb0.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/b45fa3e6-d971-4d47-8422-2d86f2d759eb.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "除了ETF所对应的各类指数，在A股中，还有一个典型的指数，也是采用了低买高卖的指数调仓策略，那就是微盘股指数。红利类指数和微盘指数不是胜在公司质量有多好，核心是持续低买高卖的调仓策略，让他们的净值曲线走势几乎保持了不变的斜率：",
      "path": "assets/figure_009.png",
      "sha256": "8d816614d1ac0a3028ccc16d08f5611a277b634e65bb37b54b31978fb0a7e708",
      "bytes": 461265,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 740,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/b45fa3e6-d971-4d47-8422-2d86f2d759eb.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/94bc95be-194c-4be5-bce1-b685fa3730c4.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "这里就不得不引出另外一个话题，在A股市场中，大多数情况下，在一个较低位置买入一个股票，拉一个中长期维度来看，这个股票出现一个比较明显上涨，或者跑赢其它股票的概率，都相对比较大。",
